{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Kandinhale</strong> is a story-driven short RPG game in which you'll have to escape from the clutches of <i>Kandinhale</i>, the\u00a0company that owns almost the entire consumable market in this\u00a0idyllic candy world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3448010/extras/Sugar_Image.png?t=1745508981\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Estimated playtime:</strong> <i>30 minutes - 45 minutes</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Number of endings:</strong> <i>7</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore Kandinhale's factory and discover its secrets!</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Content warning</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Themes about death, blood, violence, implied\u00a0suicide, mention of substance use and prostitution, mild cursing, mild jumpscares, syringes\u00a0\u00a0and strong images.\u00a0</i></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3448010?t=1745508981","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3448010?t=1745508981","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3448010/9d6ce454a9da8c547136739e7cc8bed220d4c88c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745508981","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3448010/9d6ce454a9da8c547136739e7cc8bed220d4c88c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745508981","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"Themes about death, blood, violence, implied suicide, mention of substance use and prostitution, mild cursing, mild jumpscares, syringes  and strong images. "},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Kandinhale</strong> is a story-driven short R